# Terraform local cache and state
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.log

# Terraform lock file should normally be committed, so do NOT ignore it
# .terraform.lock.hcl

# Python virtual environment
.venv/

# Optional: if you actually have a terraform-bootstrap directory
# terraform-bootstrap/.terraform/
# terraform-bootstrap/*.tfstate
# terraform-bootstrap/*.tfstate.backup
